{:event/actor "seb" :event/at #inst "2026-07-29T17:41:29.002Z" :event/body {:fact/path [:summary] :fact/value "explain.cljc:86 lets :alternatives fall through to true, and actionability ranks it 9. So for-actor shows an actor a block they cannot act on AND leaves it out of :hidden - precisely what :hidden exists to prevent (no renderer can silently pretend the rest does not exist). next.cljc gets this right by flattening options through reason->action; for-actor should reuse that."} :event/parents #{"sha256-8c4fa36a1f6b7cb2f20b0fc62caf77f0c7e44ad95ae42c4dec190174882fa7dc"} :event/ticket #uuid "e81b4320-6d65-4ca4-bed5-3931d83657d6" :event/type :fact/assert}